      "id": "Infrastructure.Data.CosmosDb",
      "range": "[10.2.1, )"
    },
    "message": "  All versions before 10.0.0 are built on the legacy, end-of-life\n  Microsoft.Azure.DocumentDB SDK and target older .NET frameworks. They are\n  no longer maintained. The 10.x line is a full rewrite on the current\n  Microsoft.Azure.Cosmos v3 SDK targeting .NET 10. Upgrade to 10.2.1 or later.\n\n  This is a major, breaking upgrade: the CosmosClient is now injected via DI\n  (use AddCosmosClient / AddCosmosClientWithNewtonsoft) instead of being\n  created internally, Settings.TimeOut was removed, and the API surface\n  changed. See the README and CHANGELOG for the migration.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
